PROJECT: EtherFi

## System Architecture

Arsitektur: Modular liquid restaking protocol di atas Ethereum L1 dengan multi-chain deployment weETH melalui canonical bridge dan third-party bridge (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Architecture, https://docs.ether.fi/architecture; EtherFi Blog V2, https://blog.ether.fi/etherfi-v2-liquid-restaking/]
Layer Settlement: Ethereum Mainnet (L1) — semua eETH, weETH, ETHFI token, dan smart contract inti dideploy di Ethereum (HIGH) [Etherscan eETH, https://etherscan.io/token/0x35fA164735182de50811E8e2E824cFb9B6118ac2; Etherscan weETH, https://etherscan.io/token/0xCd5fE23C85820F7B72D0926FC9b05b43E359b7ee]
Layer Execution: EVM-compatible chains (Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain) — weETH di-deploy sebagai ERC-20 non-rebasing di setiap chain (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Multi-chain, https://docs.ether.fi; Arbiscan weETH, https://arbiscan.io/token/0x...; Optimistic Etherscan weETH, https://optimistic.etherscan.io/token/0x...; Basescan weETH, https://basescan.org/token/0x...]
Cross-chain Messaging: Canonical bridge (Optimism Portal, Arbitrum Bridge, Base Bridge) + third-party bridge (LayerZero, Wormhole, Hyperlane) untuk weETH distribution — detail implementasi per-chain tidak dipublikasikan secara terpusat (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Bridging, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging; LayerZero Docs, https://docs.layerzero.network; Wormhole Docs, https://docs.wormhole.com]
Oracle Network: Chainlink Price Feeds untuk ETH/USD dan eETH/weETH pricing di vault dan liquidation logic — adres feed per chain tidak dipublikasikan secara agregat (MEDIUM) [Chainlink Docs, https://docs.chain.link; EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults]
Restaking Layer: EigenLayer (Actively Validated Services) + Symbiotic — eETH dan weETH didelegasikan ke AVS melalui EigenLayer StrategyManager dan Symbiotic Vault (HIGH) [EigenLayer Docs, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz; Symbiotic Docs, https://docs.symbiotic.fi; EtherFi Docs Restaking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking]
Data Availability: EigenDA (via EigenLayer AVS) untuk operator node Ultra Light Node — opsional, tergantung AVS yang dipilih operator (MEDIUM) [EigenDA Docs, https://docs.eigenda.xyz; EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node]
Appchain/Service Network: Tidak ada appchain dedikasi — EtherFi beroperasi sebagai smart contract protocol di atas existing chain (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

## Core Components

Nama: eETH (Liquid Staking Token)
Fungsi: ERC-20 rebasing token mewakili staked ETH + auto-compounding staking reward + restaking reward; supply bertambah via rebase setiap epoch
Status: Live di Ethereum Mainnet sejak 2023
Sources: (HIGH) [Etherscan eETH, https://etherscan.io/token/0x35fA164735182de50811E8e2E824cFb9B6118ac2; EtherFi Docs eETH, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/eeth]

Nama: weETH (Wrapped eETH)
Fungsi: ERC-20 non-rebasing wrapper untuk eETH — 1 weETH = 1 eETH (fixed balance), nilai meningkat via price appreciation; kompatibel DeFi dan cross-chain bridge
Status: Live di Ethereum Mainnet + 10+ L2/L1
Sources: (HIGH) [Etherscan weETH, https://etherscan.io/token/0xCd5fE23C85820F7B72D0926FC9b05b43E359b7ee; EtherFi Docs weETH, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/weeth]

Nama: ETHFI Token
Fungsi: ERC-20 governance token — voting DAO, fee accrual (fee switch), incentive alignment
Status: Live sejak TGE 18 Maret 2024
Sources: (HIGH) [Etherscan ETHFI, https://etherscan.io/token/0xfe0c30065b384f05761f15d0cc899d4f9f9cc0eb; CoinMarketCap ETHFI, https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/etherfi/]

Nama: EtherFi Staking Contract (DepositContract / StakeManager)
Fungsi: Menerima ETH deposit, mint eETH, mengelola validator delegation ke node operator, mengakumulasi reward, handle withdraw request
Status: Live di Ethereum Mainnet (V1 2023, V2 2023-11)
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; EtherFi Docs Staking, https://docs.ether.fi/staking]

Nama: weETH Wrapper Contract (WETH9-style / eETHWrapper)
Fungsi: Mint/burn weETH terhadap eETH deposit/withdraw; handle rebase accounting via share/price mechanism
Status: Live di Ethereum Mainnet + multi-chain deployment
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; EtherFi Docs weETH, https://docs.ether.fi/tokens/weeth]

Nama: EigenLayer Integration (StrategyManager / DelegationManager)
Fungsi: Delegasikan eETH/weETH ke EigenLayer AVS melalui Strategy; handle slashing, reward distribution, withdrawal queue
Status: Live sejak 2023-08 (EigenLayer mainnet integration)
Sources: (HIGH) [EigenLayer Docs, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz; EtherFi Docs Restaking, https://docs.ether.fi/restaking]

Nama: Symbiotic Integration (Vault / Network)
Fungsi: Delegasikan eETH/weETH ke Symbiotic networks/Vault; alternatif restaking layer
Status: Live sejak 2024-03
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Symbiotic Docs, https://docs.symbiotic.fi; EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]

Nama: EtherFi Vaults (Vault Contract)
Fungsi: Institutional-grade vault — alokasi otomatis eETH/weETH ke multi-AVS (EigenLayer + Symbiotic) dengan risk parameter, slashing protection, withdrawal queue
Status: Live sejak 2024-02; v2 2024-12
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults; EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]

Nama: Ultra Light Node (ULN) Marketplace Contract
Fungsi: Permissionless operator registry — operator mendaftar, staker mendelegasikan eETH ke operator, operator menjalankan validator + AVS duties
Status: Live sejak 2024-02
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node; EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]

Nama: EtherFi DAO Governance (Governor / Timelock)
Fungsi: On-chain governance — proposal, voting (ETHFI token), execution via timelock; parameter protocol, treasury, upgrade
Status: Live sejak 2024-03 (post-TGE)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Governance, https://docs.ether.fi/governance; Snapshot, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]

Nama: EtherFi Cash Smart Contract Wallet / Card Contract
Fungsi: Non-custodial smart contract wallet terhubung ke kartu kredit fisik/virtual — spending yield dari restaked ETH/stablecoin
Status: Live sejak 2024-01; expansion ongoing
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Cash Site, https://cash.ether.fi; EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]

Nama: Bridge Contracts (Canonical + Third-party)
Fungsi: Mint/burn weETH di destination chain saat bridging; lock/unlock di source chain
Status: Live di 10+ chain
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Bridging, https://docs.ether.fi/bridging; Arbiscan weETH, https://arbiscan.io; Optimistic Etherscan weETH, https://optimistic.etherscan.io; Basescan weETH, https://basescan.org]

## Consensus Mechanism

N/A — EtherFi bukan blockchain/consensus layer; protocol berjalan di atas Ethereum (PoS) dan L2 yang mewarisi consensus dari chain masing-masing (HIGH) [Ethereum Consensus, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/; EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

## Execution Environment

EVM (Ethereum Virtual Machine) — semua smart contract EtherFi ditulis untuk EVM dan dideploy di Ethereum Mainnet serta EVM-compatible L2/L1 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Mode, Blast, Linea, Scroll, zkSync Era, Mantle, BNB Chain) (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; EtherFi Docs, https://docs.ether.fi]

## Programming Languages

Solidity (smart contract) — versi ^0.8.20+ (dikonfirmasi dari repository contracts) (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts]
TypeScript/JavaScript (frontend, SDK, testing, scripts) — React/Next.js untuk app.ether.fi, ethers.js/viem untuk interaction (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Frontend, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/frontend; EtherFi GitHub SDK, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/sdk]
Rust (off-chain infrastructure, operator node software untuk ULN, indexer) — detail repositori operator tidak sepenuhnya publik (MEDIUM) [EtherFi GitHub, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol; EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node]
Go (beberapa off-chain services, relayer, indexer) — tidak dikonfirmasi secara resmi; inferensi dari ekosistem umum (LOW) [Tidak ada sumber resmi yang dikonfirmasi]

