## Security Model

Validator Set: Permissionless node operator melalui Ultra Light Node — operator mendaftar di ULN registry, staker mendelegasikan eETH, operator menjalankan Ethereum validator + EigenLayer AVS duties (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs ULN, https://docs.ether.fi/ultra-light-node; EtherFi Blog ULN, https://blog.ether.fi]
Slashing Protection: EigenLayer slashing mechanics diteruskan ke staker — operator yang melakukan slash di AVS akan mengurangi nilai eETH/weETH yang didelegasikan; Vaults memiliki risk parameter dan slashing insurance logic (MEDIUM) [EigenLayer Docs Slashing, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/slashing; EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults]
Multi-sig / Timelock: Protocol upgrade dan parameter changes melalui DAO governance (Governor + Timelock) — minimal 2 hari timelock sebelum eksekusi (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Governance, https://docs.ether.fi/governance; Snapshot, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]
Upgradeable Proxy: UUPS (ERC-1967) proxy pattern untuk core contracts (StakeManager, Wrapper, Vaults) — upgrade hanya melalui governance timelock (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts UUPS, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; OpenZeppelin UUPS, https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/4.x/upgradeable]
Reentrancy Protection: ReentrancyGuard (OpenZeppelin) pada semua external functions yang transfer value (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts imports, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; OpenZeppelin ReentrancyGuard, https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/4.x/api/security#ReentrancyGuard]
Access Control: AccessControl (OpenZeppelin) role-based — DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE, OPERATOR_ROLE, PAUSER_ROLE, UPGRADER_ROLE terpisah (HIGH) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts imports, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; OpenZeppelin AccessControl, https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/4.x/api/access#AccessControl]
Pausability: Pausable (OpenZeppelin) pada core contracts — emergency pause oleh PAUSER_ROLE (multi-sig/DAO) (MEDIUM) [EtherFi GitHub Contracts imports, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/contracts; OpenZeppelin Pausable, https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/4.x/api/security#Pausable]
Oracle Security: Chainlink Price Feeds dengan heartbeat dan deviation threshold — vault liquidation menggunakan price feed dengan circuit breaker (MEDIUM) [Chainlink Docs Security, https://docs.chain.link/data-feeds/l2-chains; EtherFi Docs Vaults, https://docs.ether.fi/vaults]
Audit Coverage: Multiple audit firms (lihat Audit History) — smart contract core, vault, ULN, bridge contracts diaudit sebelum/ setelah deployment (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Security Audits, https://docs.ether.fi/security/audits; GitHub Audits, https://github.com/etherfi-protocol/audits]
Bug Bounty: Immunefi bug bounty program — reward hingga $X (jumlah tidak dipublikasikan dalam dataset ini) (MEDIUM) [Immunefi EtherFi, https://immunefi.com/bounty/etherfi; EtherFi Docs Security, https://docs.ether.fi/security]

