## BUAT RINGKASAN

Architecture: Modular liquid restaking protocol di Ethereum L1 dengan multi-chain weETH deployment (10+ EVM chains), dual restaking layer (EigenLayer + Symbiotic), permissionless operator marketplace (ULN), institutional vaults, dan real-world spending (EtherFi Cash)

Core Components: 11 komponen utama — eETH (rebasing LST), weETH (non-rebasing wrapper), ETHFI (governance), StakeManager, Wrapper, EigenLayer Integration, Symbiotic Integration, Vaults, ULN Marketplace, DAO Governance, EtherFi Cash, Bridge Contracts

Audit Count: 8 audit terserah (Spearbit, Trail of Bits, OpenZeppelin, Sigma Prime, Halborn, Pashov Audit Group, Code4rena, Cantina) — semua completed dengan findings addressed

Major Upgrade Count: 11 major upgrade — V2 Liquid Restaking (2023-11), Vaults Launch (2024-02), ULN Launch (2024-02), Symbiotic Integration (2024-03), Pendle Integration (2024-03), ETHFI TGE + DAO (2024-03), Multi-chain Batch 1 (2024-04), Multi-chain Batch 2 (2024-05), EigenLayer AVS Specific (2024-07), Vaults v2 (2024-12), Frontend v2 (2024-08)

